{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55065","headline":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 二十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 二十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兄独发，有寇伏埋藏。\n且莫提兵行远路，急行前必有惊惶，不信见灾（辛本、川本作「遭」）殃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}